n's stories with a delightfully dark twist!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/82984ce7941c04aaf16c51e465646fdb.poster.avif?t=1771841093\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/82984ce7941c04aaf16c51e465646fdb.webm?t=1771841093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stepping into the well-worn shoes of Detective Cox, a soft-boiled amnesiac squirrel,  get to the bottom of this murder the only way you know how \u2014 through a series of seemingly pointless yet surprisingly fun mini-games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A HUGE Variety of Nostalgic Mini-Games!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/70eddfb8fac01c0598bc83129eab1d31.poster.avif?t=1771841093\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/70eddfb8fac01c0598bc83129eab1d31.webm?t=1771841093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/70eddfb8fac01c0598bc83129eab1d31.mp4?t=1771841093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with your trusty Detective Essentials (a magnifying glass, tape recorder and crowbar - just in case),  solve puzzles, analyse crime scenes, interrogate townsfolk and unturn stones to solve six gruesome crimes. Come to think of it, that\u2019s a worrying number of crimes for one small village\u2026 Are you sure y