 together the mystery of Orchard Under Hill by completing a wide variety of familiar mini-games that not only help you solve the mysteries in town, but also act as payoffs for their own punchlines! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/18ea7831b7d9267207b94983043bbfc2.poster.avif?t=1771841093\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/18ea7831b7d9267207b94983043bbfc2.webm?t=1771841093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/18ea7831b7d9267207b94983043bbfc2.mp4?t=1771841093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/317e3bffdda1acf2c3c312b9cbd39849.avif?t=1771841093\" width=600 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crack the Case Wide Open Like an Egg! A CHICKEN EGG?! It's all adding up...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detective Cox is set on becoming the Greatest Detective in the World! Help him search for clues, solve puzzles, and learn about this story-rich world of troubled animals as they all try to survive in a civilisation  on the brink of crisis. Speaking of  troubled animals...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453640/extras/aecc00139a13f00e104afa7579af5061.avif?t=1771841093\" width=600 height=125 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store